      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Deep frying is a common cooking method around the world. Many people like the taste of fried foods. Yet these foods are high in "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "calories",
            "ref": "v-calorie"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trans fats",
            "zh": "反式脂肪"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". So eating a lot of them can have bad effects on your health."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Unlike most other cooking methods, deep frying adds a lot of calories. Because when foods are fried in hot oil, they lose water and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "absorb",
            "ref": "v-absorb"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " fat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Deep frying also changes the chemical "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "structure",
            "zh": "结构"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of fats. It turns them into trans fats. Trans fats are formed when oils are heated to very high temperatures during cooking. As a result, fried foods are very likely to contain trans fats."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Trans fats are difficult for your body to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "break down",
            "ref": "v-break-down"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and can lead to bad effects on your health. In fact, trans fats can cause many diseases, including heart disease, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cancer",
            "ref": "v-cancer"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "diabetes",
            "zh": "糖尿病"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Therefore, we’d better eat fewer fried foods."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
